norse.text:
Þá gekk Geitir
Grípi at segja;
"Hér er maðr úti
ókuðr kominn;
hann er ítarligr
at áliti;
sá vill, fylkir,
fund þinn hafa."

english.text:
"Now fare thee well! | our fates we shun not;
And well has Gripir | answered my wish;
More of joy | to me wouldst tell
Of my life to come | if so thou couldst."
